    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Channelling the power of your mark, you ward yourself from damage in a shimmering golden aura, becoming indestructible. For the duration of the spell, you are immune to any effect or damage that would harm you, excluding effects caused by artefacts, deific power, and similarly powerful sources. You can still be affected by anything you're willing to have affect you.</p>"
